  "question": {
    "text": "Two women and some men participated in a chess tournament in which every participant played two games with each of the other participants. If the number of games that the men played between them-selves exceeds the number of games that the men played with the women by<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>66</mn></math>, then the number of men who participated in the tournament lies in the interval"
  },
